  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nThe PIRATE WARRIORS series has successfully combined the popular anime ONE PIECE with the thrilling action of the WARRIORS series to create a worldwide phenomenon selling more than four million copies!<p></p>\n<p>Based on the concept of “fighting hordes of enemies while adventuring with trusted allies,” experience awesome ONE PIECE action lifted straight from the anime!</p>\n<p>ONE PIECE: PIRATE WARRIORS 4 is the latest evolution of PIRATE WARRIORS action! Based on the concept of “experiencing a real ONE PIECE battlefield,” buildings will come crashing down during the action and attacks will throw up smoke and dust, placing you in the thick of the ONE PIECE world!</p>\n<p>Injecting fresh elements that couldn’t be achieved in previous entries has now realized an even more thrilling brand of PIRATE WARRIORS action!</p>\n<p><b>Included DLCs:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Whole Cake Island Pack\n</li><li>The Worst Generation Pack\n</li><li>Land of Wano Pack\n</li><li>Anime Song Pack\n</li><li>Month 1 Bundle\n</li><li>Charlotte Katakuri Early Unlock\n</li><li>The Battle of Onigashima Pack\n</li><li>One Piece Film: Red Pack\n</li><li>Legend Dawn Pack\n</li><li>Yamato’s Grand Tour Logbook &amp; Soul Map 1\n</li><li>Onigashima Battle Law Costume\n</li><li>Additional Episodes Pack\n</li><li>One Piece Film: Red Anime Song Pack\n</li><li>Koby’s Combat Chronicle &amp; Soul Map 2\n</li><li>Path to the King of the Pirates &amp; Soul Map 3\n</li><li>Shanks Additional Special Move “Divine Departure”\n</li><li>Character Pack 7 Future Island Egghead Pack\n</li><li>Character Pack 8 Special Selection\n</li></ul>\n<p>Character Pass, Character Pass 2 &amp; Character Pass 3 are not actual DLCs, hence not counted.</p>\n",
